pened.\r\n\r\n### Steps to reproduce\r\n\r\nDetach the code editor as a floating window.\r\nType characters that need modifier keys (may depend on the Locale being used)\r\nWitness it produces nothing ... at some point (exact triggering condition unknown)\r\n\r\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\r\n\r\nN/A","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98732/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98732/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}